{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Hmm...most unusual.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^In all my experience I have not seen something like this before...","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^Meow. Who are you?","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^I am Scientish.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^An ocean renowned researcher and scientist.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^They have labs down here?","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^Never mind that.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^I need this thing, it belongs to a girl above shore.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^But how will you get it up there?","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^By my calculations, with your skinny frame and the object’s weight","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^you will never be able to carry it.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^...rude.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^I must do some more experiments.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^Normally I work alone, as there is no one as smart as me","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^but alas I think I need your help.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^I thought you were ‘ocean renowned’.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Mock","/#","^Shut up and listen.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^...I am?","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^I have gathered research from the shore that will aid us in removing this unknown object.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^As I said earlier","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^you will never be able to carry it alone.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^Yeah, I get it.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^But if it were broken up into pieces that were more proportionate to your physical abilities","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^you could haul it back to shore piece by piece.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^I guess that makes sense.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^Of course it does.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^There are five steps in total","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^And each step will require you to find or craft a tool.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^What?? I’m not making tools!","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Shock","/#","^What do you think I am??","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Shock","/#","^Once you have these tools","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^you will use them to break up the guitar and thus carry it to the shore with ease.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^No. Not happening.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","^I have found no alternative.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^I wanted to do something nice, but this is too much.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^I’m going back to the beach.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^I thought you said the object belonged to a girl.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^...yeah. It does.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^Will she not be missing it?","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^Don’t guilt trip me. I’m a cat not an engineer.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^Fine.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^I will have to find another way to destroy it.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^...no, you can’t destroy it.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Shock","/#","^You’re very indecisive.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","^Alright, alright, I’ll do it.","\n","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","^Great! Here you’ll need this stone.","\n","#","^speaker: Scientish","/#","end",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}